{"id":"3406156270","t":"Go Deok-chun’s Food Truck","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/c6a761676c2180d1-193x278.jpg","n":41,"l":41,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck"},"u":1795038839832,"desc":"يرث “جونهو” شاحنة طعام عمه الراحل “دوك تشون”، وينطلق في رحلة طهي عبر البلاد ليجعل اسم “غو دوك تشون” معروفًا في كل الأرجاء! بدءًا من “سيهي”، وريثة العائلة الثرية، يجد “جونهو” نفسه متورطًا مع نساء يمتلكن قصصًا وماضٍ مثير في كل منطقة يزورها! جميعهن يقعن في سحره وتُسلب قلوبهن… لكن الشيء الوحيد الذي سلب قلب “جونهو” حقًا هو الطبخ فقط! رحلة رومانسية مليئة بنكهات شاحنة الطعام عبر البلاد بطلها الرجل ذو السحر الطاغي “جونهو” — “حسنًا، فلنبدأ العمل!”","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","الحياة اليومية","حريم","دراما","رومانسى","طبي","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/1/"},"2":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/2/"},"3":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/3/"},"4":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/4/"},"5":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/5/"},"6":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/6/"},"7":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/7/"},"8":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/8/"},"9":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/9/"},"10":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/10/"},"11":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/11/"},"12":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/12/"},"13":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/13/"},"14":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/14/"},"15":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/15/"},"16":{"ml":"go-deok-chuns-food-truck|/manga/go-deok-chuns-food-truck/16/"},"17":{"m